                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                    RRSI（Google, 2026.9）
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#999999' }}>
                    Regularized Recursive Self-Improvement
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    针对固定 evolve 集改进 harness，通过<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C8102E' }}>七层正则化</span>约束搜索轨迹
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, marginTop: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333333' }}>
                        Terminal-Bench 2.1: 74.2 → <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C8102E' }}>80.2</span> (+6.0)
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666' }}>
                        OOD 保持：SWE-bench +1.8
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{
                background: '#F8F8F8',
                borderRadius: 6,
                padding: 14,
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                gap: 6,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#666666', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                    七层正则化
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    退火编辑预算 · 历史条件提议 · 停滞重定向 · 批评者预筛 · 噪声调整下限 · 成本规则 · 剪枝
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
            flex: 1,
            display: 'flex',
            flexDirection: 'column',
            gap: 14,
        }}>
            <Box style={{
                border: '1px solid #E5E5E5',
                borderRadius: 8,
                padding: 16,
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                gap: 8,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                    Harness²（Google, 2026.10）
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#999999' }}>
                    Recursive Agent Harnessing for an Open World
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    面向开放世界，<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C8102E' }}>无需 ground-truth</span> 的对比式精炼
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, marginTop: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333333' }}>
